		{
			dependencies: ["7652B74B3DA4A030"]
			description: [
				"Works for all ship types!"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Press R set sail and W to increase and S to decrease the Sail."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"To dismount a entity from the ship, Right-Click&r the entity."
				"To open the Inventory outside of the ship, use Shift&r + Right-Click&r on the ship."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"You can customize sails by coloring them with dye items."
				"You can name your ship with a name-tag."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"You can repair your ship with &aIron Nuggets&r and Planks&r. Simply Right-Click&r the ship with the Iron Nuggets&r in your hand, you need to have a good supply of &aPlanks&r in your inventory."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Leashing allows players to tether ships. Leashed ships cannot be directly controlled, and only ships without a player on the controller seat can be leashed."
